      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, with the many dangers it holds,\r\nlately there are none who dare approach it...\r\nMaster Arisen, should you go a gathering trip,\r\ncould you report the conditions inside?",
        "Jp" : "しかし、その危険さゆえに最近は\r\n近づこうとする人さえ見かけません――\r\n覚者殿、もし採集に出向かれるのなら\r\n中の状態を確認してきてはいただけないでしょうか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 789156,
